<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 29 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 29 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Australia by 29 runs in their limited overs World Series match at Bellerive Oval on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores - Pakistan 149 all out in 45.2 overs (Mohammad Wasim 54); Australia 120 all out in 41.3 overs.</p>
